   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">05 JULY 2018, PAMPANGA, PHILIPPINES - Lowell Rebillaco, an agriculturist from the Dpeartment of Agriculture Region III office, discuss with trainees and other participants in a week-long drone training and mapping project in Pampanga, considred as one of the provinces that is part of the 'rice bowl' of the Philippines or the ones supplying rice in the Philippines. &#xA;&#xA;&amp;#xA;FA0/VEEJAY VILLAFRANCA</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
